<p>Build a complete, premium, visually stunning, production-quality website for a local salon business in Azamgarh, Uttar Pradesh, India.</p>
<p>IMPORTANT: Do not just create a plan, mockup, or static design. Build the actual working website, implement all pages and interactions, install necessary dependencies, test the website, and fix errors before finishing.</p>
<p>BUSINESS DETAILS
Address: Infront of Judgi Maidan, Near Narauli Bridge, Civil Lines, Azamgarh, Uttar Pradesh 276001
Contact: 080524 38328
Total customer reviews: 406</p>
<p>Do not invent the salon's name, exact ratings, prices, services, opening hours, social media accounts, or customer testimonials. Use an editable placeholder such as "LUXE SALON" for the brand name.</p>
<p>DESIGN:
Create an elegant luxury salon website with deep espresso (#211714), warm ivory (#FAF5EF), champagne gold (#C7A477), muted rose (#D8B6AC), and charcoal (#292524). Use Playfair Display or Cormorant Garamond for headings and Inter or Manrope for body text. Use generous whitespace, refined typography, beautiful photography, tasteful borders, subtle shadows, and polished hover effects.</p>
<p>BUILD THESE SECTIONS:</p>
<ol class="list-inside list-decimal whitespace-normal [li_&amp;]:pl-6" data-streamdown="ordered-list">
<li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item">Sticky responsive navigation with logo, Home, Services, About, Gallery, Reviews, Contact, and Book Appointment.</li>
<li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item">Cinematic hero with salon imagery, heading "Where Beauty Meets Elegance.", supporting copy, Book Appointment and Explore Services buttons, subtle reveal animations.</li>
<li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item">Trust section highlighting 406 reviews without inventing star ratings.</li>
<li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item">Service cards for haircut and styling, hair colouring, hair spa, skincare, makeup, manicure and pedicure. Keep suggested services editable and do not invent prices.</li>
<li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item">About section with editorial layout and professional, realistic copy.</li>
<li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item">Responsive gallery with filters and accessible lightbox. Never represent stock imagery as actual salon work.</li>
<li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item">Why Choose Us section with four elegant feature blocks.</li>
<li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item">Reviews section showing 406 reviews and an honest placeholder until genuine reviews or a verified review link is supplied. Never fabricate testimonials.</li>
<li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item">Appointment enquiry form with name, Indian phone number, service, preferred date/time, message, validation, loading/success/error states, and secure server-side handling. Do not claim an appointment is confirmed unless the salon responds. If no database or backend is configured, explain the limitation.</li>
<li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item">Contact section with the supplied address and phone, clickable telephone link, Google Maps directions link, and a map only if the location can be reliably resolved. Keep unknown opening hours hidden.</li>
<li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item">Premium footer with logo, navigation, address, phone, and dynamic copyright year.</li>
</ol>
<p>ANIMATIONS:
Use Framer Motion if compatible or a lightweight alternative. Add subtle scroll reveals, staggered animations, image zoom, elegant button transitions, and an animated mobile menu. Respect prefers-reduced-motion and ensure animations remain smooth on Android phones.</p>
<p>TECH STACK:
Use React, TypeScript, Vite, Tailwind CSS or structured CSS, Lucide icons, and compatible animation tools. Build reusable components and a responsive single-page website with working navigation.</p>
<p>QUALITY:
Mobile-first design, semantic HTML, accessible keyboard interactions, descriptive alt text, optimized lazy-loaded images, SEO metadata, Open Graph tags, appropriate LocalBusiness structured data based only on verified information, custom favicon or wordmark, no exposed secrets, no fake ratings, no dead buttons, no broken links, no horizontal overflow, and no console errors.</p>
<p>FINAL EXECUTION:
Do not stop at a plan. Implement the website, install dependencies, run it, and test all interactions. Check mobile layout at approximately 360px, test form validation, verify phone and directions links, check image loading and console errors, and fix issues before finishing. Ensure the Replit preview works and summarize any external configuration still required.</p>
<p>FINAL GOAL: A distinctive, premium custom-designed salon website with sophisticated colors, beautiful typography, high-quality imagery, tasteful animations, excellent mobile responsiveness, and genuinely working functionality. Begin implementation immediately.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="flex box-border min-h-0 min-w-0 border-0 border-solid view-outline-none flex-col justify-logical-start items-center shrink-0"><button data-ruic="Button" data-analytics-instrumented="" type="button" tabindex="0" data-react-aria-pressable="true" aria-expanded="false" class="rounded-6 [[data-rui-diagnostics]_&amp;:not([data-ruic])]:outline-offset-2! [[data-rui-diagnostics]_&amp;:not([data-ruic])]:[outline:2px_solid_var(--accent-negative-default)]! appearance-none border-0 border-solid border-transparent transition-background-color duration-snappy ease-snappy custom-focus-not-focus-visible:outline-transparent custom-focus-visible-active:transition-none custom-focus-visible-active:outline-accent-primary-default custom-disabled:cursor-not-allowed custom-disabled:opacity-50 select-none bg-transparent custom-hover:underline custom-focus:underline custom-focus:outline-thick custom-focus:outline-solid custom-focus:-outline-offset-thin custom-focus:outline-accent-primary-default custom-focus:forced-colors:outline-[Highlight] flex min-h-0 min-w-0 basis-auto cursor-pointer flex-row items-center shrink-0 self-auto justify-center h-auto px-0 gap-100 text-(--foreground-dimmer) aria-expanded:mt-200" data-rac="" id="react-aria7633357524-:ruf:"><span class="flex min-w-0 items-center gap-200 text-xs"><span class="min-w-0 grow truncate text-left">Show more</span></span></button></div></div></div><div class="flex box-border min-h-0 min-w-0 border-0 border-solid view-outline-none justify-logical-start shrink-0 flex-row items-center gap-200"><div role="group" aria-label="Free, Auto" class="flex box-border min-h-0 min-w-0 border-0 border-solid view-outline-none justify-logical-start shrink-0 f